Create a professional and visually attractive PowerPoint presentation on the topic:

SOLAR SYSTEM AND PLANETS

Group Presentation – Member 2

Create exactly 4 slides. The presentation should take approximately 4 minutes to explain.

Target audience: College students and teachers.

Language: Simple, easy-to-understand English. Avoid complicated scientific terminology.

Design Theme:

- Use a dark blue or black space-themed background.
- Use attractive images of planets, the Sun and space.
- Use white text with colourful headings.
- Include realistic space images and educational illustrations.
- Use clean layouts, readable fonts and short bullet points.
- Make the PPT look modern, professional and engaging.
